menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_DEVICE_MQTT
    bool "Enable the device MQTT command contract"
    default y
    help
        Parses platform-to-device command envelopes from the shared MQTT
        contract, validates the topic-derived device identity, suppresses QoS 1
        duplicate deliveries, and builds idempotent command acknowledgements.
        The transport connection is owned by the composition root once the
        production broker endpoint and client certificate are confirmed.

endmenu
